= Fernando de los Ríos

Fernando de los Ríos is a distinguished legal scholar and the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>'s Minister of Justice - a humanist socialist who has made reform of the reactionary judiciary his cause. [? if judicial_reform >= 2: He carries considerable weight across the factions now that the <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> has pushed real judicial reform through. ?]


- @judiciary_major
- @judiciary_minor
- @constitutional_reform_
- @root: Return to main


@judiciary_major
title: Enact major judicial reforms.
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and psoe_in_government and justice_minister_party = "PSOE" and budget > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not currently in government. ?][? if justice_minister_party != "PSOE" : We do not hold the Justice Ministry. ?] [? if budget <= 0: Not enough budget. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6;
go-to: judiciary.reform

@judiciary_minor
title: Enact minor judicial reforms.
subtitle: Gradually remove corrupt and biased judges.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and psoe_in_government and justice_minister_party = "PSOE"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not currently in government. ?][? if justice_minister_party != "PSOE" : We do not hold the Justice Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6;
go-to: judiciary.minor_reforms


@constitutional_reform_
title: Constitutional Reform
subtitle: Pursue reforms of the 1931 Constitution.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and psoe_in_government and justice_minister_party = "PSOE" and (in_republican_socialist or in_popular_front) and judicial_reform >= 2 and neorevisionism
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_in_government : The PSOE is not currently in government. ?] [? if justice_minister_party != "PSOE" : We do not hold the Justice Ministry. ?] [? if not neorevisionism: We do not have ideological support for constitutional reform yet - new ideas are needed. ?] [? if judicial_reform < 2: The judiciary is unlikely to tolerate progressive constitutional changes. ?] [? if not (in_republican_socialist or in_popular_front) : Our current governing coalition will not support constitutional reforms. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; constitutional_reform_timer -= 12
go-to: constitutional_reform
